        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 458AR, Classic Half Round Knob with Arched Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Classic Half Round Prodigy Knobset is not called classic without a reason. The beauty of this knob and rose set is found in the traditional styling, a nod to days gone by without looking outdated. A simple way to bring a quiet elegance to your home with minimal effort. Omnia's 458AR Half Round Knob With Arched Rose is available in single dummy, double dummy, passage and privacy functions. Both the single dummy and the double dummy functions feature concealed surface mounting for easy installation. The passage and privacy functions are available for either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets and the two functions are packaged for both 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\" thick doors. Available in 7 finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Omnia 458AR Half Round Knob with Arched Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Concealed screw mounting.</li>\r\n<li>Full lip strike comes standard.</li>\r\n<li>55° rotation to retract latch.</li>\r\n<li>Covers 2-1/8\" bore hole.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/prodigy-installation.pdf?v=1704262303\"><b>Omnia Prodigy Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia 458AR Half Round Knob with Arched Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Optional 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A stationary knob for use as a pull or to match trim on one side of door. Includes 1 knob, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A stationary knob for use as a pull or to match trim on both sides of door. Includes 2 knobs, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, 2 sub-roses, tubular latch, strike plate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages\r\n privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside knob will release privacy and retract latchbolt. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, 2 sub-roses, privacy button, tubular latch, strike plate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Classic Half Round Prodigy Knobset, Omnia 458AR",
                "description": "Half Round Knobset, Omnia 458AR - The Classic Half Round Prodigy Knobset is not called classic without a reason. The beauty of this knob and rose set is found in the traditional styling, a nod to days gone by without looking outdated. A simple way to bring a quiet elegance to your home with minimal effort. Omnia's 458AR Half Round Knob With Arched Rose is available in single dummy, double dummy, passage and privacy functions. Both the single dummy and the double dummy functions feature concealed surface mounting for easy installation. The passage and privacy functions are available for either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and the two functions are packaged for both 1-3/8 inch or 1-3/4 inch thick doors. Available in 7 finishes.",
                "keywords": "OMN-458AR, Traditional Half Round Knobs, Omnia 458AR Half Round Knob with Arched Roses, Fancy Solid Brass Half Round Knobs, Half Round Knob With Arched Roses, Traditional Half Round Knobsets, Half Round knobsets, Traditional knobs, classic knobs, Traditional knobsets, classic knobsets, omnia prodigy collections, solid brass door knobs, Omnia Standard door knobs, classic knobs, traditional knobs, passage knobs, privacy knobs, Classic Half Round Prodigy Knobsets,"
